---
mm: 1.2
kind: test
name: sdl-linux-aarch64-capture
option: buildable-host no
requires-board: sdl-linux-aarch64
use: mm.display
use: mm.touch
unit: tests/boards/sdl-linux-aarch64/main.cpp
---

# SDL screenshot and touch-script test

Runs platform.linux.sdl headless, with SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen, and checks
the unattended-capture controls: MM_SCREENSHOT_DIR with MM_SCREENSHOT_EVERY
writes every second refreshed frame as a PPM equal, pixel for pixel, to what
was drawn; MM_TOUCH_SCRIPT replaces the pointer with scripted taps and holds,
shoots a named frame, and ends the run.
